# Requests for the WebApi sample (Visual Studio, Rider and VS Code's REST Client run this file).
@host = http://localhost:5080

### Upload a document; the response has the job id
POST {{host}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="install-guide.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../tests/RagDotNet.Evaluation/Dataset/base/formats/pdf/install-guide.pdf
--sample--

### Check the job (replace the id with the one returned above)
GET {{host}}/jobs/REPLACE-WITH-JOB-ID

### Ask a question
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "What command installs Quill with winget?" }
